{"version":1,"content":"<p>《中年好聲音3》冠軍黃博及《中年好聲音》首屆亞軍李佳，即將聯手舉行首個雙人音樂會：《黃博x李佳「共鳴時刻音樂會」廣州站》！</p><p>是次演出更是2人自《中年好聲音》斬獲殊榮後，首度以Solo歌手身分於廣州合作開騷，和一眾歌迷相聚同歡。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.819553+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T06:11:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T08:57:38.183206+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416480+00:00","content_hash":"09cf885d37434e8f85e8defe9346f6e1960673890c95799bbc41327eaeb40ee7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}